OL,3,GNEWSABBC and Netflix composer up for
OL,4,Anational award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA composer whose work has featured on
OL,7,Fthe BBC and Netflix says he is "really
OL,8,Fhumbled" to be nominated for a national
OL,9,Faward.
OL,11,FThomas Farnon, from Guernsey, whose
OL,12,Fcredits include the BBC's Mammals,
OL,13,Fnarrated by Sir David Attenborough, and
OL,14,FNetflix's Our Planet II, has been
OL,15,Fnominated for an Ivors Composer Award.
OL,17,FHis score for David Frost Vs... is
OL,18,Fshortlisted in the Best Original
OL,19,FDocumentary Score category at the
OL,20,Fawards, which recognise composers for
OL,21,Ftheir contribution to contemporary
OL,22,Fculture.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
