OL,3,GNEWSABBC and Netflix composer up for
OL,4,Anational award
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarnon, whose grandfather was also a
OL,7,Fcomposer, said the Ivors had inspired
OL,8,Fhim since childhood after seeing one on
OL,9,Fhis grandfather's shelf but believing
OL,10,Fone of his own was "out of reach".
